.DS_Store
# The LangGraph checkpointer (M5). The `-wal` and `-shm` siblings are SQLite's
# runtime journal + shared memory: they are recreated on every open and churn on
# every goal. A bare `data/goalflow.db` does NOT match them — that is how a 4MB WAL
# got committed in v3-M6 — so the glob has to be explicit.
data/goalflow.db
data/goalflow.db-*

# The scratch household store (v6). GOALFLOW_PROFILE_PATH points a demo run at a
# copy so capture does not write to the committed seed; the copy itself is a run
# artefact — the path FINAL_DEMO.md tells you to configure, so it is ignored here
# rather than left for someone to `git checkout` after every rehearsal.
data/memory/demo_profile.json
